Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.15,0:00:02.32,Default,,0,0,56,,Every sales team has the same leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:04.64,Default,,0,0,56,,Not bad products, not bad salespeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:07.80,Default,,0,0,56,,Leads that go quiet, and nobody follows up\Nin time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.15,0:00:12.14,Default,,0,0,56,,Take Maria. She wanted a blue RAV4 Hybrid\Nnine days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:14.50,Default,,0,0,56,,Her last contact was a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.57,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,56,,That car sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.75,0:00:19.80,Default,,0,0,56,,A silver alternative sat at the same\Ndealership for 74 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.15,0:00:23.04,Default,,0,0,56,,Nearly half of qualified leads are\Nmishandled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:25.80,Default,,0,0,56,,Most eventual buyers purchase within three\Ndays.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.15,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,56,,Sales slip away when nobody connects
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,56,,the lead to the right offer in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:35.09,Default,,0,0,56,,SalesDesk is your AI enterprise sales\Nanalyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:39.80,Default,,0,0,56,,It does that review overnight and prepares\Nthe follow-ups for your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:44.61,Default,,0,0,56,,At 2 AM, it starts reviewing each store's\Nleads and inventory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:48.80,Default,,0,0,56,,Six stores run in parallel, in isolated\Nsandboxes on Vultr.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.15,0:00:50.80,Default,,0,0,56,,Let's look at Sandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.15,0:00:56.90,Default,,0,0,56,,SalesDesk reviews its 375 open leads and\Nflags 40 that need attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.98,0:01:00.43,Default,,0,0,56,,Twenty-five have gone at least three days\Nwithout contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:03.56,Default,,0,0,56,,Others are waiting on a car that has sold,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.63,0:01:06.80,Default,,0,0,56,,or have an appointment that needs\Nfollowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:09.36,Default,,0,0,56,,It then checks the available inventory:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:11.64,Default,,0,0,56,,117 cars at Sandy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:14.80,Default,,0,0,56,,and more than sixteen hundred at nearby\Nsister stores.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:19.42,Default,,0,0,56,,Each potential match is scored against\Nwhat the customer asked for,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:22.70,Default,,0,0,56,,including the model, trim, budget and\Nmileage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.77,0:01:26.80,Default,,0,0,56,,Cars that have been in stock longer get\Nextra priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.15,0:01:29.91,Default,,0,0,56,,Qwen, running on Vultr Serverless\NInference,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,56,,uses those checked results to write\NSandy's morning brief
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:36.80,Default,,0,0,56,,and three follow-up drafts for its\Npriority leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.15,0:01:40.34,Default,,0,0,56,,The recorded review finishes across all 24\Nstores
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.80,Default,,0,0,56,,in two minutes and seven seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.15,0:01:44.80,Default,,0,0,56,,Here's Maria's result.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.15,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,56,,The silver RAV4 is the same model and trim\Nshe originally asked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:55.80,Default,,0,0,56,,It scores 98 out of 100, with the colour\Ndifference shown in the breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:58.99,Default,,0,0,56,,The manager can see her original enquiry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.06,0:02:01.20,Default,,0,0,56,,when she was last contacted,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:05.80,Default,,0,0,56,,and when the blue car sold, all in the\Nsame view.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.15,0:02:10.36,Default,,0,0,56,,Below that is a draft message mentioning\Nthe available silver RAV4
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.43,0:02:14.43,Default,,0,0,56,,and asking about her 2017 Honda CR-V\Ntrade-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.50,0:02:17.34,Default,,0,0,56,,The salesperson has the context and a\Nmessage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.41,0:02:19.80,Default,,0,0,56,,ready to review before contacting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.15,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,56,,By the morning, Sandy's manager has a\Nranked queue of 40 follow-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:28.97,Default,,0,0,56,,They can review individual drafts or\Napprove the queue together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,56,,then download the tasks and drafts for\Ntheir salespeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:39.29,Default,,0,0,56,,Across the group, 1,007 at-risk leads have\Nbeen matched to a car in stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:44.34,Default,,0,0,56,,The estimated gross associated with those\Nmatches is about $3.4 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:48.80,Default,,0,0,56,,Managers can use that view to decide where\Ntheir teams should focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:53.37,Default,,0,0,56,,The scheduler and analysis jobs run on a\NVultr VM.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:56.13,Default,,0,0,56,,Qwen runs on Vultr Serverless Inference,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:03:00.80,Default,,0,0,56,,and its output is validated before it\Nreaches the approval queue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.15,0:03:05.45,Default,,0,0,56,,SalesDesk gives your team a practical\Nstarting point each morning:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.52,0:03:08.06,Default,,0,0,56,,which customers to follow up with,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:12.80,Default,,0,0,56,,which cars to offer, and a draft they can\Nwork from.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:16.80,Default,,0,0,56,,SalesDesk. Your AI enterprise sales\Nanalyst.
